		"message" "string" "Lots of smartprops support tinting, but come in a \ndefault color.\n\nOn this model, the default material (blue) is not tintable and \nchoosing a tint color will not have an effect. \n\nIn order to use tinting, make sure to choose a \ntint material variant within the smartprop and\nassign a tint color after.\n\nSome materials even support blend painting and tinting.\n(tint_blend_01a , tint_blend_01b)\n"
