		"message" "string" "The roofkit allows you to create a shingle style roof.\n\nMove the pivot to the top corner of the building:\nHold Tab, left click on the corner vertex, then press \"Ctrl + D\"\nto lock in the pivot position.\n\nWith the roofkit smartprop selected, hover over the building\nhammergeometry and press \"Alt + T\". You might have to compensate\nfor the rotation angle by rotating the smartprop to the correct orientation.\n\nDrag out the sliders and select your options to create the roof.\n\n\n"
