		"message" "string" "The baggage cart has rotators for the front axle and the connector.\n\nTo build a train of carts, place the first model and position the wheel as desired.\nCopy the model and Enable \"Adjust Pivot for Assembly\" in the Smartprop options.\nWith the second cart selected, hover your cursor over the locator\nhelper of the first cart and press \"Alt+T\" To Align.\n\nTo Cycle through tarp options, select over over the circular helper on\nthem and \" mousewheel up\" or \"mousewheel down\" to change them.\n"
